  "design_notes": [
    "Listed for C1, C2 and C5 for the same reason as satellite power: the table sits under \"7.2.1 Satellite contracts (C1, C2, C5)\" and names no single contract.",
    "The table has no Strengths, Cost or Twin column. \"Expensive\" (reaction wheels + star tracker) has no number, so no cost_M is stored.",
    "Pointing accuracy \"~5°\", \"~0.1°\", \"~0.01°\" is stored without the tilde. Stats are tagged game_value: the design states no provenance for them.",
    "The qualitative drawbacks are flags: too_imprecise_for_high_res_imaging, slow_slew, wheel_saturation, star_tracker_sun_blinding. The design does not say which instrument counts as high-resolution, so there is no incompatible_with_part rule.",
    "Section 6.7 mentions single, dual or triple reaction-wheel configurations; the table offers none."
  ],
